{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Get the authenticated binary upload endpoint and product/crop headers. Pass productId from list_products for every image. Upload each required image separately; retain the returned IDs in slot order. Crops and resolution checks use that product\u2019s artwork specifications, not a universal 4x6 size. POST the image bytes separately; never put base64 or remote image URLs in MCP. For recoverable uploads, send a stable Idempotency-Key on POST and check GET /api/uploads/{key} after a lost response. Retry the same bytes and options with the same key; never retry payment as an upload recovery step. SDK: https://photoprintagent.com/sdk/photo-upload.mjs. No storage is allocated until upload. JPEG, PNG/APNG, WebP, GIF, HEIC/HEIF, TIFF, AVIF, BMP and self-contained SVG are supported. Read acceptedMimeTypes, acceptedExtensions and imageHandling for frame/page selection, transparency, and limits. Use application/octet-stream when MIME type is unavailable. Unsupported encodings must be converted before upload.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"crop":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"fit":{"default":"cover","enum":["cover","contain"],"type":"string"},"orientation":{"default":"landscape","enum":["landscape","portrait"],"type":"string"},"x":{"default":50,"maximum":100,"minimum":0,"type":"number"},"y":{"default":50,"maximum":100,"minimum":0,"type":"number"}},"type":"object"},"guestToken":{"description":"Private guest credential; omit when Authorization Bearer is present.","pattern":"^ppg_[a-f0-9]{64}$","type":"string"},"productId":{"pattern":"^[a-z0-9][a-z0-9-]{1,63}$","type":"string"}},"type":"object"},"name":"create_upload","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"ac